TarisOS: in Power saver (the power profile the user chose, as power-profiles-daemon saves it at
each change: /var/lib/power-profiles-daemon/state.ini, watched with inotify, since this daemon
can't reach the session's bus) the Touch Bar dims and goes off twice as fast, and only its own use
counts (a touch, or Fn, which switches its keys), not the keyboard's or the trackpad's. The
profile is also there for taris-unlit-keyboard.patch.

